    "what_en": "Claude runs a hypothesis-driven debugging loop: reads the runtime reference first, forms at least three hypotheses, confirms root cause from observed runtime state, locks the fix with a failing-first test, then reverts every debug artifact.",
    "when_en": "Use when you hit crashes, silent failures, hangs, wrong responses and similar bugs, or need reverse engineering; also fits intermittent failures that only show up in CI.",
    "say_en": [
      {
        "text": "A service hangs intermittently; walk the debug loop and find the root cause",
        "note": "Reads the runtime reference before Phase 0"
